{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-6","kind":"proposition","title":"垂直同一平面的两条直线互相平行","englishTitle":"If two straight lines be at right angles to the same plane, the straight lines will be parallel.","book":11,"number":6,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":6,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","contentId":"euclid-11-6","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fb1abacff262df1df68b490de0551c937210d075ac5b7d8cb20d3789adcbc65d","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-6.statement","euclid-11-6.construction.1","euclid-11-6.construction.2","euclid-11-6.proof.1","euclid-11-6.proof.2","euclid-11-6.proof.3","euclid-11-6.proof.4","euclid-11-6.proof.5","euclid-11-6.proof.6","euclid-11-6.proof.7","euclid-11-6.proof.8","euclid-11-6.proof.9","euclid-11-6.conclusion","euclid-11-6.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-6.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0bc5a5b91d9f4f809bee7bc293cba61bcd58753ad3e7dba28f42185a526aab90","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two straight lines be at right angles to the same plane, the straight lines will be parallel."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两条直线在直角到平面之间,直线将平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cf1364a12835a1a4e35927307ae790269374314d23b5eb95b2d78460b8946a4a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the two straight lines AB, CD be at right angles to the plane of reference; I say that AB is parallel to CD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将第AB、CD两条直线定为直角至平面参考线;我说,AB与CD平行。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8d60436eb9204a9264d7d73c6e2225c3fc5bd50dc39e3077ad2355491369756","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let them meet the plane of reference at the points B, D, let the straight line BD be joined, let DE be drawn, in the plane of reference, at right angles to BD, let DE be made equal to AB, and let BE, AE, AD be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将它们相交的B点、D点的参考线相交,BD点的直线相连,平面点的直角点至BD点的DE点的引用线相交,DE点的引用线等于AB,BE、AE、AD点的链接。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"df2551d41090c4ce2bdf123e39d32125b474e56ac9d535428e69125afbb720bf","citations":["euclid-11-def-3"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now, since AB is at right angles to the plane of reference, it will also make right angles with all the straight lines which meet it and are in the plane of reference. [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,由于AB是直角 参考,它也将使直角 与所有直线相交,并处于平面 参考。 [[XI. Def. 3](/principles/euclid-11-def-3)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"bca8f27438b04c3952e5cf206d1b3b258420646aa31071b0c0d516022393a285","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But each of the straight lines BD, BE is in the plane of reference and meets AB; therefore each of the angles ABD, ABE is right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BD,BE的直线 都在平面参考线中 相交了AB,因此每个角度 ABD,ABE是正确"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1d3a506cd99ff7828b767cea4521196f893169de1332e5960c00ea78d6c2b2c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For the same reason each of the angles CDB, CDE is also right."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"出于同样的原因,每个角度CDB,CDE也是对的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5cd060194258f8f73726142bf7fe74379deaf1f721d6f4b267f2d9703aa1470b","citations":["euclid-1-4"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is equal to DE, and BD is common, the two sides AB, BD are equal to the two sides ED, DB; and they include right angles; therefore the base AD is equal to the base BE. [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB等于DE,BD是共同的,双方AB,BD等于ED,DB;它们包括直角;因此,底边,AD等于底边,BE。 [[I. 4](/principles/euclid-1-4)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"de45245dbdeef9da32e99fe73937da928b8242b8e8fda13ab1ab626eface8119","citations":["euclid-1-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since AB is equal to DE, while AD is also equal to BE, the two sides AB, BE are equal to the two sides ED, DA; and AE is their common base; therefore the angle ABE is equal to the angle EDA. [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由于AB等于DE,AD也等于BE,双方AB,BE等于双方ED,DA;AE是双方共同的底边;因此,角度ABE等于角度EDA。 [[I. 8](/principles/euclid-1-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d461fe74cd8c230a25c47027970adc995a24ebe5fc0f0aeb94bfbc53451626b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the angle ABE is right; therefore the angle EDA is also right; therefore ED is at right angles to DA."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABE该角是直角,因此EDA角度也是正确的,因此ED角度为直角至DA。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"953db41c212690670b8eca60d0b9468e564934ebc123a2e6ab417bda88f32615","citations":["euclid-11-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also at right angles to each of the straight lines BD, DC; therefore ED is set up at right angles to the three straight lines BD, DA, DC at their point of meeting; therefore the three straight lines BD, DA, DC are in one plane. [[XI. 5](/principles/euclid-11-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但BD、DC直线各为直角;因此,ED直线在相交点为直角,BD,DA,DC;因此,3条直线BD、DA、DC是一条平面。 [[XI. 5](/principles/euclid-11-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a27ac006e04b40e679b9e82ee5ec7f356da2766305b10bac309223e43a731b0e","citations":["euclid-11-2"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, in whatever plane DB, DA are, in that plane is AB also, for every triangle is in one plane; [[XI. 2](/principles/euclid-11-2)] therefore the straight lines AB, BD, DC are in one plane."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,不管平面 DB,DA,平面也是AB, 因为每个三角形都位于平面; 因此,直线AB,BD,DC位于平面。 [[XI. 2](/principles/euclid-11-2)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a1ffb7790a05e02532416f6f7093660e2487999b7db5696456c58ebdafdb33bb","citations":["euclid-1-28"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And each of the angles ABD, BDC is right; therefore AB is parallel to CD. [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"每一个角度ABD,BDC是正确的, 因此AB是CD。 [[I. 28](/principles/euclid-1-28)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":12,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-6.source","contentId":"euclid-11-6","revisionId":"euclid-11-6@raw-fb1abacff262df1d","order":13,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"57480ec1fd4963baf0f1ff6a478f2b765880b21000fa1e43b3a92c36b26c55b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-6:euclid-11-def-3:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-6.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-def-3","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"XI. Def. 3"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-6:euclid-1-4:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-6","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-6.proof.4"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-4","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.6/","sourceLabel":"I. 4"}},{"id